ugh the spoiler parts  whatever your thoughts are drop  something down in the comments let's  talk about it  if i'm very lucky there will be a link  to my patreon  up over there i think i might figure out  how to get that working again we'll see  there are  there's rewards at every tier including  a patreon specific discord  and of course names in the credits as  you are now currently seeing  give it a look it's my living it's what  keeps this whole things going but also  no pressure the usual stuff  of like share subscribe helps me out as  well but don't worry about that either  because at the end of the day you're the  council i'm just running the meetings  and until next time this council is  adjourned  [Music]  bye
 

